# NOTE: Cargo.lock is intentionally committed. This workspace builds a binary
# (glpi-agent) and depends on pre-release crypto crates (p384, elliptic-curve,
# primefield via russh/ssh-key). Without a committed lockfile, CI re-resolves
# these rc.* versions to an incompatible set and fails to compile. Keep it tracked.
